{"kind":"stack","id":"stk-light-reflection","title":"Light is reflected from surfaces","theme":{"background":"#1e2a38","foreground":"#f5f7fa","font":"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Reflection"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"When light hits a shiny surface and bounces back off it, we call this reflection."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What happens to light when it hits a mirror?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"It bounces back off the mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"It soaks into the glass and disappears","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"It turns into sound","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"mirror"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which surface reflects light best?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A polished metal spoon","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A woolly jumper","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A sponge","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"You are walking home on a sunny day and you see a puddle on the path. Do you stop to look at the sun shining in the water, or do you keep walking?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Stop and look at the reflection","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Keep walking past the puddle","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"You crouch down and see the sky and the trees clearly in the still water. The sunlight bounced off the puddle into your eyes."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You keep walking. You miss the bright sky that the puddle was showing you. Light still bounced off it, but you did not look."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Smooth surface"},{"type":"text","id":"c7-e","content":"A smooth, shiny surface reflects light in a clear, sharp way, so you can see an image in it."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Why can you see your face in a shiny spoon?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Light reflects off the spoon into your eyes","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"The spoon makes its own light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Your face sends sound into the spoon","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which of these is the best reflector of light?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"A clean mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"A rough brick wall","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"A black cloth","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"What do we call light bouncing off a surface?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Reflection","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Absorption","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Vibration","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-q","content":"Which surface would give you the clearest reflection?"},{"type":"button","id":"c11-a","label":"Still water in a pond","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-b","label":"A bumpy cardboard box","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-c","label":"A fluffy towel","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c12","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c12-h","content":"Well done, you finished the light reflection lesson!"},{"type":"text","id":"c12-m","content":"You now know that light bounces off smooth, shiny surfaces and that this lets us see reflections. Keep looking for reflections around you."}],"actions":[]}}
